From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] comctl32: list view work areas, insertion mark, background images, info tips; tree view states

The list view had no work areas (LVM_GETNUMBEROFWORKAREAS said 1,
LVM_GETWORKAREAS failed, LVM_SETWORKAREAS was not handled), no insertion
mark, outline colour, LVM_GETBKIMAGE or LVM_SETINFOTIP, no incremental
search string, LVA_SNAPTOGRID arranged instead of snapping, background
image styles, offsets and files were FIXMEs, LVS_EX_INFOTIP showed
nothing, and the small icon view had no approximate rect. The tree view
ignored extended item states, TVE_EXPANDPARTIAL and TVSI_NOSINGLEEXPAND
and had no incremental search string.

List view:
- Work areas: set (up to 16), read, counted; icons are arranged in the
  first one.
- LVA_SNAPTOGRID puts each icon on the nearest free cell of the grid.
- The insertion mark (LVM_SETINSERTMARK, GETINSERTMARK,
  GETINSERTMARKRECT, INSERTMARKHITTEST, its colour), drawn as a bar with
  end ticks before or after its item; the outline colour.
- LVM_GETISEARCHSTRING: the incremental search string while a search
  goes on.
- Background images: tiled (from an offset with LVBKIF_FLAG_TILEOFFSET),
  placed at offset percentages, or a watermark in the corner (alpha
  blended if asked); from a bitmap or a file (LVBKIF_SOURCE_URL); read
  back with LVM_GETBKIMAGE. The old image is deleted first, as before.
- Info tips: LVM_SETINFOTIP keeps an item's tip; with LVS_EX_INFOTIP,
  hovering an item asks the parent (LVN_GETINFOTIP, with that tip) and
  shows the answer in the tooltip, gone when the mouse leaves the item.
- LVM_APPROXIMATEVIEWRECT in the small icon view.

Tree view:
- Extended item states (TVIS_EX_FLAT, TVIS_EX_DISABLED) are kept and
  read back; a disabled item is grayed and a click does not select it.
- TVE_EXPANDPARTIAL expands and marks the item TVIS_EXPANDPARTIAL (its
  button still shows a plus); collapsing clears it.
- TVM_SELECTITEM with TVSI_NOSINGLEEXPAND does not expand in a
  single-expand tree.
- TVM_GETISEARCHSTRING.

Wine's comctl32 listview (7238) and treeview (4658) tests: no failures,
as before.

Gate: test/lvtv-gate.sh (Xvfb, test/lvtv-probe.c).
Mutants SG_MUTANT_NO_INFOTIP (comctl32/listview.c),
SG_MUTANT_SINGLE_EXPAND_ALWAYS (comctl32/treeview.c).
